OL,3,GNEWSASalmond sought to pardon William
OL,4,AWallace in 'humorous' exchange, inquiry
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former Lord Advocate has revealed
OL,8,FAlex Salmond once asked him to
OL,9,Finvestigate a pardon for the medieval
OL,10,FScottish knight, William Wallace.
OL,12,FLord Mulholland, who served as
OL,13,FScotland's top law officer from 2011 to
OL,14,F2016, said he was unsure whether the
OL,15,Flate first minister's request was
OL,16,Fserious, adding the conversation was
OL,17,F"humorous" and did not lead to any
OL,18,Fformal action.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
