OL,3,GNEWSASalmond sought to pardon William
OL,4,AWallace in 'humorous' exchange, inquiry
OL,5,Ahears
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was giving evidence to a committee
OL,8,Fof MPs investigating the dual role of
OL,9,Fthe Lord Advocate, who leads Scotland's
OL,10,Fprosecution service and sits in the
OL,11,FScottish cabinet.
OL,13,FThe committee is holding an inquiry
OL,14,Finto the case of Peter Murrell, the
OL,15,Fformer SNP chief executive convicted of
OL,16,Fembezzlement.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
